WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:04.760
Speaker 1: OK, let's get into audience questions,
the first one, one that I am asked so often,

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:09.470
David, why does it appear to be more profitable
to be a right wing grifter than it does to

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:15.130
be a left wing grifter, either someone who
pretends to have changed sides or have a political

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:21.349
awakening or simply put out ideas that even
they don't believe merely because it makes

00:00:21.349 --> 00:00:22.349
money?

00:00:22.349 --> 00:00:28.289
There are two reasons why right wing grifting
is so much more popular than left wing grifting.

00:00:28.289 --> 00:00:35.110
The the two reasons are, number one, the left
doesn't really care about people who have

00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:41.440
these opposite a supposed Awakening's or come
to realize that what they've been fed by their

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:42.660
side is wrong or whatever.

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:44.420
The left doesn't care about it in the same
way.

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:47.360
And number two, there's just less money available
on the left for it.

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:55.950
So we'll explain this one by one, the idea
of someone who used to be on the left and

00:00:55.950 --> 00:01:02.060
now is on the right as someone we should pay
particular attention to is much more exciting

00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:03.270
to the right.

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:04.830
The left doesn't care.

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:08.210
People call into the show all the time and
say, I had an awakening.

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:09.259
I'm on the left now.

00:01:09.259 --> 00:01:10.560
I used to be a right winger.

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:12.350
I fell down the rabbit hole.

00:01:12.350 --> 00:01:15.530
It's interesting in the sense that I'm curious,
how did you get out?

00:01:15.530 --> 00:01:17.409
Because we know it's tough to get out.

00:01:17.409 --> 00:01:19.460
But my reaction is a very muted.

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:22.440
Oh, so you looked at the facts and now you
better understand things.

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:24.870
You're no longer falling for propaganda.

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:26.979
You now understand the real world.

00:01:26.979 --> 00:01:30.719
And so, of course, now you're on the same
side I'm on, which is the side of empiricism

00:01:30.719 --> 00:01:32.750
and facts and so on and so forth.

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:34.490
Now let's try to get something done.

00:01:34.490 --> 00:01:35.740
Let's get the right people elected.

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:38.369
Let's try to fix some problems in society.

00:01:38.369 --> 00:01:41.219
What you see on the right is completely different.

00:01:41.219 --> 00:01:47.180
When Dave Rubin supposedly had an awakening
from being a burny guy to saying liberalism

00:01:47.180 --> 00:01:50.729
is a mental disorder, he was ushered into
Prager.

00:01:50.729 --> 00:01:56.539
You to do a video about how he left the left
when Candice Owens I mean, Candice Owens story

